 the actual issue once \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bmore. Issue: \"Add a GitHub Actions workflow that runs Claude Code when an issue gets \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bthe \u001b[38;5;153magent\u001b[39m label: it reads the issue, makes the fix on a new branch, and opens a pull \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Brequest with it for us to review. The API key is in the repository secret \u001b[23m\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;153m\u001b[2m\u001b[3mANTHROPIC_API_KEY\u001b[39m.\" Our workflow: - Runs on issues labeled, if label == agent. ✓ - \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1BRuns Claude Code via anthropics/claude-code-action@v1. ✓ - Passes anthropic_api_key \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bsecret. ✓ - Reads issue via gh issue view. ✓ - Creates new branch claude/issue-N. ✓ -\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1BClaude makes fix, tests, commits, pushes, opens PR. ✓ - PR for review. ✓ Potential \r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[22m \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m\u001b[3mconcerns: 1. The action's agent mode runs in auto mode; \u001b[38;5;153m--allowedTools\u001b[39m narrow rules. \r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[22m     \u001b[2m\u001b[3mDoes \u001b[38;5;153mgh issue view\u001b[39m have GH_TOKEN during the session? As verified, run.ts…\u001b[23m\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;174m✢\u001b[11G\u001b[38;5;216mg…\u001b[41G\u001b[38;5;246mthought for 11s)\u001b[39m\u001b[34;1H\u001b[32;3H"]
