4C\u001b[1B- read the issue and i\u001b[28Gs \u001b[31Gomments with \u001b[38;5;153mgh issue view … --comments\u001b[39m,\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bmake\u001b[12Ga focu\u001b[19Ged\u001b[22Gfix\u001b[26Gfollowing \u001b[38;5;153mCLAUDE.md\u001b[39m, with a Vitest test where\u001b[72Gbehavior\u001b[81Gchanges,\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Brun \u001b[38;5;153mnpm run typecheck\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;5;153mnpm test\u001b[39m, and \u001b[38;5;153mnpm run build\u001b[39m,\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bcommit, push, and open\u001b[30Ga PR against the default branch\u001b[62G(\u001b[38;5;153mFixes #N\u001b[39m).\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GVerifies afterwards\u001b[25Gthat\u001b[31Gn open PR exists for the branch, and fails\u001b[74Gloudly\u001b[81Gif\u001b[84Gnot.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BUses l\u001b[12Gast-privilege write permissions plus a per-issue \u001b[38;5;153mconcurrency\u001b[39m gr\u001b[77Gp, and\u001b[84Gleaves\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G\u001b[38;5;153m.github/\u001b[39m off-limits to Claud\u001b[34G.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;153m\u001b[1mREADME.md\u001b[13G\u001b[22m\u001b[39m—\u001b[15Gshort\u001b[21G\"Agent\u001b[28Gfixes\"\u001b[35Gsection\u001b[43Gdocumenting\u001b[55Gthe\u001b[59Glabel\u001b[65Gworkflow.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe\u001b[7Gworkflow\u001b[16Guses\u001b[21Gthe\u001b[25GClaude\u001b[32GGitHub\u001b[39GApp\u001b[43Gtoken\u001b[49G(standard\u001b[59G\u001b[38;5;153mclaude-code-action\u001b[78G\u001b[39msetup)\u001b[85Grather\u001b[34;1H\u001b[32;3H"]
